rebellion against the monarchy. Oh, against talking the proud. Because he disguised himself as an idiot. So I think that's what's going on there. So the idea that they're dressing up in kind of ludicrous costumes, they're disguising the fact that secretly they're ruthless killers. Yes. And the funny thing is that they don't think they're the conspirators. They think the conspiracy is somebody else. Because as this Richmond newspaper says, the conspiracy is a secret Negro conspiracy which has for its object the establishment of Negro domination. This is the kind of language they use all the time, by the way. So two obvious questions.
